      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 2-micrometer Cr2O3 coating can be deposited on AlCoCrFeNi by magnetron sputtering.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2-micrometer Cr2O3 coating will improve the high-temperature oxygen resistance of AlCoCrFeNi.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will reduce oxide-scale thickness by at least 50% relative to uncoated AlCoCrFeNi after exposure at 1000°C in air for 100 hours.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention produces a dense Cr2O3 scale.",
